{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/47681-antagonists","id":47681,"title":"Antagonists","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-12T16:26:59-08:00","id":47681,"title":"Antagonists","content":"I was wondering if I could get some help with fairy tale-esque antagonists for my upcoming game. So far I've come up with a hag (modeled after the hag of Henslowe Park found in AN) and some sort of mermaids that try to kill people.<br /> Any suggestions for me?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1924-roanscribbles","name":"roanscribbles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1924_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T18:44:35-08:00","id":47791,"title":"","content":"A sentient wolfskin that turns those who wear it into sinister werewolf-looking things defined by their Vices.<br /> An immensely clever and charismatic cat conspiring to conquer the freehold. It can't <i>talk</i>, but is still making good progress.<br /> A gargantuan toad looking for a wife \u2013 <i>another</i> wife\u2013 whose innards are a palatial Hollow.<br /> A Darkling running a fifties-style diner, whose cursed jukebox causes people to dance until their identities fall apart. He's trying to build himself a mortal existence from the scraps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png",